This skill can be used by elemental [[Pet Guide|pets]]. Though its not seen much and its unclear when and how pets decide to use it; it may occur at low health when fighting large groups of mobs.

The ability allows the pet to attack all enemies around them, not unlike an extra [[Skill_Cleave|Cleave]] attack.

